&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;2017年９月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 549px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;厚生労働大臣の許可を受け、登録型派遣も可能な労働者派遣事業に切り替え、当該業務に係る兼業承認を法務大臣から取得&lt;/p&gt;
